    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/7d6b576a261b7bd0e8fdf45e420ddcd7.poster.avif?t=1738067866\" width=644 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/7d6b576a261b7bd0e8fdf45e420ddcd7.webm?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/7d6b576a261b7bd0e8fdf45e420ddcd7.mp4?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A game for the mushroom lovers around the world! Surreal, psychedelic artwork made entirely from real mushroom images combined with a rich, organic soundscape. Come explore a mycological world full of fantastically fungal charm! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/5ccc4046e006ac7e66745d8f8f043bb5.poster.avif?t=1738067866\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/5ccc4046e006ac7e66745d8f8f043bb5.webm?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/5ccc4046e006ac7e66745d8f8f043bb5.mp4?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>An evil mushroom is spreading its poison throughout the ecosystem. You must discover the secrets to stop it by solving puzzles, interacting with the environment, and getting help from your fungal friends. Turn on, tune in and drop out, because this is gonna be one long, strange trip!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/b75369e1eed9d94794c894d3b5358ddb.poster.avif?t=1738067866\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/b75369e1eed9d94794c894d3b5358ddb.webm?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/b75369e1eed9d94794c894d3b5358ddb.mp4?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/7d6b576a261b7bd0e8fdf45e420ddcd7.poster.avif?t=1738067866\" width=644 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/7d6b576a261b7bd0e8fdf45e420ddcd7.webm?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/7d6b576a261b7bd0e8fdf45e420ddcd7.mp4?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>A game for the mushroom lovers around the world! Surreal, psychedelic artwork made entirely from real mushroom images combined with a rich, organic soundscape. Come explore a mycological world full of fantastically fungal charm! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/5ccc4046e006ac7e66745d8f8f043bb5.poster.avif?t=1738067866\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/5ccc4046e006ac7e66745d8f8f043bb5.webm?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/5ccc4046e006ac7e66745d8f8f043bb5.mp4?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>An evil mushroom is spreading its poison throughout the ecosystem. You must discover the secrets to stop it by solving puzzles, interacting with the environment, and getting help from your fungal friends. Turn on, tune in and drop out, because this is gonna be one long, strange trip!</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/b75369e1eed9d94794c894d3b5358ddb.poster.avif?t=1738067866\" width=624 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/b75369e1eed9d94794c894d3b5358ddb.webm?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2580280/extras/b75369e1eed9d94794c894d3b5358ddb.mp4?t=1738067866\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
